<figure class="spool-diagram">
	<svg
		viewBox="4 8 852 244"
		role="img"
		aria-label="A Spool node sends traces to Tempo, logs to Loki and metrics to the OpenTelemetry Collector, which passes them to Prometheus. Grafana shows all three."
	>
		<defs>
			<marker id="ob-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
				<path class="arrowhead" d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" />
			</marker>
		</defs>

		<rect class="process" x="20" y="74" width="170" height="112" rx="8" />
		<text class="small" x="32" y="94">Spool node</text>
		<text class="name" x="105" y="122" text-anchor="middle">crawler</text>
		<text class="name" x="105" y="144" text-anchor="middle">ingester</text>
		<text class="name" x="105" y="166" text-anchor="middle">janitor</text>

		<rect class="box" x="330" y="20" width="170" height="44" rx="6" />
		<text class="name" x="415" y="47" text-anchor="middle">Tempo</text>
		<rect class="box" x="330" y="108" width="170" height="44" rx="6" />
		<text class="name" x="415" y="135" text-anchor="middle">Loki</text>
		<rect class="box" x="330" y="196" width="170" height="44" rx="6" />
		<text class="name" x="415" y="223" text-anchor="middle">OTel Collector</text>
		<rect class="box" x="560" y="196" width="130" height="44" rx="6" />
		<text class="name" x="625" y="223" text-anchor="middle">Prometheus</text>
		<rect class="box" x="720" y="100" width="120" height="60" rx="6" />
		<text class="name" x="780" y="135" text-anchor="middle">Grafana</text>

		<line class="edge" x1="190" y1="92" x2="327" y2="46" marker-end="url(#ob-arrow)" />
		<text class="small" x="250" y="58" text-anchor="middle">traces :4318</text>
		<line class="edge" x1="190" y1="130" x2="327" y2="130" marker-end="url(#ob-arrow)" />
		<text class="small" x="258" y="122" text-anchor="middle">logs :3100</text>
		<line class="edge" x1="190" y1="168" x2="327" y2="214" marker-end="url(#ob-arrow)" />
		<text class="small" x="250" y="214" text-anchor="middle">metrics :4320</text>

		<line class="edge" x1="500" y1="218" x2="557" y2="218" marker-end="url(#ob-arrow)" />
		<line class="edge" x1="500" y1="42" x2="717" y2="116" marker-end="url(#ob-arrow)" />
		<line class="edge" x1="500" y1="130" x2="717" y2="130" marker-end="url(#ob-arrow)" />
		<line class="edge" x1="660" y1="196" x2="737" y2="162" marker-end="url(#ob-arrow)" />
	</svg>
	<figcaption>
		The node sends each signal over OTLP to the address in its configuration. With the defaults, those are the services of the devenv stack, and Grafana shows them in one dashboard per module.
	</figcaption>
</figure>
